## **Whole Slide Imaging** ##

The OMOP `_whole_slide_imaging` table captures digital pathology images linked to patient records, supporting computational pathology and image-based research. The dataset includes image metadata such as specimen types, accession numbers, and file formats (JSON/TIFF), enabling integration of histopathology imaging with clinical and genomic data.

